A000568 speed results (v2, grouped partitions):
  T(30) = 99 digits in 0.03s
  T(40) = 187 digits in 0.20s
  T(50) = 305 digits in 1.21s
  T(60) = 451 digits in 6.4s
  T(70) = 627 digits in 29.7s
  T(80) = 833 digits in 125.0s

Formula: T(n) = (1/n!) * sum_{lambda |- n} |C_lambda| * 2^{c(lambda)}
  c(lambda) = sum_i floor(l_i/2) + sum_{i<j} gcd(l_i, l_j)
  Computed via grouped partition generator (size, multiplicity pairs)
  with precomputed gcd table.
